  "checks": {
    "about": "What a written message is checked for (Run HL7 v2 checks): 'fields' that must hold a value wherever their segment is (MSH-9 message type, MSH-10 control id, MSH-11 processing id, MSH-12 version, PID-3 patient id, PID-5 name); 'dates' written as HL7 dates (DTM: YYYYMMDD, then time and zone optional); 'codes' in their HL7 tables (0001 sex, 0063 relationship, 0103 processing id). The segments a message type requires are its profile's 'message.required'.",
    "fields": ["MSH MSH09-1", "MSH MSH09-2", "MSH MSH10", "MSH MSH11-1", "MSH MSH12-1",
